# Proxmox VE installation

## Goal
Hypervisor for my lab (RHEL 10 and Debian VMs).

## Hardware
More information in Linux_sysadmin_journey-/Hardware-Overview/01-physical-machines

## Steps
1. Downloaded the ISO from proxmox.com (version 9.2-1)
2. Made a bootable USB with dd command on Ubuntu
3. Installed on the main disk, hostname: pve
4. Opened the web interface on port 8006

## Choices made
- Static IP: 192.168.1.195 (DHCP reservation made)

## Problems and fixes
- Rufus on Windows 11 did not create a working Proxmox installation USB, I used an Ubuntu Machine and DD command to fix itl

## Check
`pveversion` shows the installed version.
